      "prism:coverDate": "1973-01-01",
      "prism:coverDisplayDate": "Oct",
      "dc:description": "Another excavator was recently taken into service in the Frimmersdorf opencast mine of the Rheinische Braunkohlenwerke AG. Its maximum stripping capacity is 112,000 m**3 a day for the overburden and 110,000 tons a day for lignite. The construction time was 43 months. The technical design of this excavator is described, and the significance and further trends in this opencast mining technique are explained.",
