      "prism:coverDate": "1971-01-01",
      "prism:coverDisplayDate": "Nov",
      "dc:description": "Unit cost of production by opencast mining is a function of opencast depth. In delineating the optimum depth and the most economic surface working limits, detailed technoeconomic evaluation is obligatory. In this paper, analytical, graphical and graphical- analytical method, being simple, quick and fairly accurate, should be the preferred method of analysis for speedy schematization of opencast mining in case of deposits of varied geological features.",
